# SSR boot payload + no flash (always on)

**Golden sentence:** Anything that paints on the **first chrome frame** and comes from Host/config/sticky prefs must travel in the **SSR HTML document**. When data can't be in the document yet, paint an explicit **loading** face until ready — never empty / default / wrong content as truth that heals later.

Applies to **Studio** (`apps/studio/`) and **ideal-stack** (`projects/*`). Canonical docs: [ssr-boot-payload.md](../../docs/architecture/ssr-boot-payload.md) · ADR [0015](../../docs/adr/0015-ssr-boot-payload.md).

## Law

```
URL / SSR boot payload / loader data  →  first paint
Later /api                            →  confirm only (same signature = no-op)
```

| Do | Don't |
| --- | --- |
| Embed first-paint prefs in HTML (JSON / CSS / tiny boot JS) | Machine default paint → post-hydrate fetch → rewrite |
| Soft-timeout Host during SSR; always return HTML | Block document on slow Host |
| Client **sync** read before that control paints | `useEffect` / connector fetch as first paint SoT |
| Re-apply only when config **signature** changes | Blind overwrite every config GET |
| Catalog new kinds in `docs/architecture/ssr-boot-payload.md` | One-off `window.__foo` with no pure/orchestrator |

## Decision tree (first paint vs hydrate)

```
Paints on first chrome frame (or default open pane)?
  NO  → normal loader / connector / machine OK
  YES → Shareable in URL?
          YES → URL owns it (params). SSR may mirror for FOUC.
          NO  → Host/config/sticky?
                  YES → SSR boot payload (this rule)
                  NO  → Ephemeral — document why; still no flash-heal
```

```
Will first paint show content that depends on Host/API/ledger?
  YES → Can SSR / route loader embed it (or a known pref)?
          YES → SSR boot / loader first paint
          NO  → Machine/status pending → loading chrome until ready
  NO  → Normal paint
```

| Situation | Paint | Fail if |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Sticky pref / config known at document | **SSR boot** or URL | Default → `/api` → rewrite face |
| List / ledger / inbox still hydrating | **Loading** (`aria-busy`, spinner/copy) | Empty-hello / "No chats" / "Inbox empty" then swap |
| User mutation in flight | Pending / optimistic | Silent wait or fake idle empty |
| Load failed | Error / retry face | Infinite spinner with no escape |

## Kinds (extend the doc table — don't fork)

| Kind | Pattern today |
| --- | --- |
| AI defaults (harness / model / mode) | `#as-boot-ai` · `studio-boot-ai-*` · `ssr-boot-ai-orchestrator` |
| Host attach (Cloud Host / Local Host) | `#as-boot-host` · `studio-boot-host-*` · `ssr-boot-host-orchestrator` |
| Capabilities / Harnesses cards | `#as-boot-capabilities` · `studio-boot-capabilities-*` |
| Workspace shell theme | SSR `<style id="as-project-shell-theme">` · `ssr-project-shell-orchestrator` |
| Color mode | `color-mode-boot.js` |
| Open tabs / project / focus | **URL** (not a second boot bag) |
| Ideal-stack first viewport | Route **loader** / SSR HTML |

**Rule of thumb:** if a screenshot in the first ~200ms after reload can show the wrong value → URL or boot payload.

## Shape (Studio)

```
ssr-render → Promise.all(orchestrators) → SsrDocument inline payload
*-pure.ts → serialize / parse / seed key
*-host.ts → document sync read (cached)
machine / session defaults ← boot before first paint
```

## Laws (loading face)

| # | Law | Fail if |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | **SSR first** — if it paints on frame one and Host already knows it, put it in the document | Client default flash then heal |
| 2 | **Loading > empty lie** — unbound / loading / leaving must not claim "no data" | Empty hero / "No chats" before ledger |
| 3 | **Ready owns empty** — only after hydrate/ready may empty copy paint | Empty and loading share the same face |
| 4 | **Pure gate** — `resolve*Face({ phase/status, … })`; not ad-hoc host `if` | Paint path guesses "probably empty" |
| 5 | **Stamp pending** — `data-*-hydrate="pending"` / `aria-busy` when loading | Spinner with no ownership |

```typescript
// chat sessions example
chatSessions phase unbound|loading|leaving
  → log + history / recents: Loading chats…
phase ready + empty log → empty hello (one New chat)
phase ready + turns → latest thread, scrolled to bottom
```

Pure: `apps/studio/client/chat/chat-hydrate-face-pure.ts`. Composer may still accept a new message while the log shows **Loading chats…**.

## Forbidden (flicker / flash class)

- Anthropic/Haiku → Cursor/Composer after config lands
- Default green shell → project brand after `design.json` fetch
- Light page → dark after `localStorage` read (use boot script)
- Global scope face → workspace after projects list hydrates **without** URL/pending
- History / recents claiming "No chats" while sessions machine still `loading` / `unbound` / `leaving`
- Two synthetic "New chat" tabs from boot stub + ledger hydrate
- "Inbox empty" before first successful ledger load
- Any "it should be fast so skip pending / skip boot"

## Agent checklist

- [ ] New first-paint pref → catalog row + pure + SSR orchestrator + sync reader
- [ ] Defaults initialized from boot (not only after `/api`); later fetch dedupes on signature
- [ ] New async list/pane: pending face until ready — never empty-as-truth mid-load
- [ ] Empty copy only after confirmed ready/error
- [ ] Not a one-off `window` global without seams
- [ ] Unit/HVT: early matches payload; late fetch does not shift

